- Inventory quantities (Inventory Intelligence)
- Pricing (Retail Intelligence)
- Promotions (Engagement Intelligence)
- Orders (Commerce)
- Customer preferences (Customer Intelligence)
- Household pantry (Household)

---

### Primary Events

